# A full-screen app: taller than the other scenes so the mascot panel fits (>= 38 rows).
Set Height 900

Hide
Type "cd $HOME_DEMO_WORK &&  clear" Enter
Sleep 800ms
Show

Type "navig dashboard" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 9s
Type "q"
Sleep 1500ms
